import JSProofs.ReactBeginCounter
import JSProofs.ReactUnitButton

/-!
# performUnitOfWork on the counter's fiber (zippy docs/react-proofs.md)

`performUnitOfWork(counter)` in the click's render: the counter's `beginWork` (`ReactBeginCounter.click_spec`: its
component re-rendered with the new count) returns the button fiber, the counter's props are memoized, and the button
fiber becomes `workInProgress`. The post carries the button fiber's state and the new props' text. Generated by
`tools/gen_react_puwc.py`.
-/

